title: A Warrant
subtitle: The police come for one of the party's leaders.
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: -1
view-if: {!
if (typeof RG === 'undefined') { return false; }
if (!RG.lw && this.game.scenes.lw_lib) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
return !!(RG.lw && RG.lw.ready('c_arrest'));
!}
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.lw) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
var c = RG.lw.fire('c_arrest');
RG.lw.setC('cm', c);
Q.lw_name = RG.pick(['a speech at a meeting in ' + RG.pick(RG.lw.TOWNS[c.district || 'berlin']), 'an article in the party press', 'a leaflet to the soldiers of the Reichswehr', 'a speech at a funeral']);
Q.lw_where = RG.pick(['Vienna', 'Prague', 'Moscow']);
!}

= A Warrant

A lawyer who sometimes does work for the party has telephoned the Zentrale from a public box. The state prosecutor has signed a warrant for **[+ lw_cm_name +]** ([+ lw_cm_role +]), for incitement to high treason, over [+ lw_name +]. The police will come tonight or tomorrow morning.

[+ lw_cm_name +] is at a meeting in [+ lw_cm_dname +] and does not know yet. [? if lw_cm_star = 1 : Half the party knows the name, and so does the other side. ?]

- @hide: Get [+ lw_cm_name +] to a safe house.
- @abroad: Smuggle [+ lw_cm_name +] across the border to [+ lw_where +].
- @trial: Let them come, and make a trial of it.
- @bail: Have the lawyers arrange a surrender and bail.

@hide
subtitle: The party hides its own. The police may find the address anyway.
on-arrival: {!
var c = RG.comrade(Q.lw_cm);
var rep = c && c.district ? RG.num(Q['district_' + c.district + '_repression']) : RG.num(Q.repression);
if (Math.random() < 0.85 - rep / 200) {
    Q.lw_out = 1;
    RG.news('Police hunt for ' + Q.lw_cm_name);
} else {
    Q.lw_out = 2;
    RG.arrest(Q.lw_cm, RG.lw.rnd(5, 9), {news: Q.lw_cm_name + ' arrested in a safe house', priority: 2});
}
RG.lw.lean('luxemburgist', 0, 1);
!}

[? if lw_out = 1 : A comrade's car meets [+ lw_cm_name +] outside the meeting hall. By midnight, [+ lw_cm_name +] is in the back bedroom of a tram driver's flat, with a new name and the curtains drawn. The police search the old address, and three others, and find nothing. ?][? if lw_out = 2 : The safe house was not safe. The police come up the back stairs at four in the morning. ?]

@abroad
subtitle: Out of reach for a few months, and out of the party's work too.
on-arrival: {!
RG.lw.sendAbroad(Q.lw_cm, RG.lw.rnd(3, 5), Q.lw_where);
!}

Two days later, [+ lw_cm_name +] crosses the border on foot, at night, with a guide from the frontier villages and a forged passport in a coat pocket. From [+ lw_where +], a postcard arrives: weather fine, comrades kind, back soon.

@trial
subtitle: Prison for a while. The trial will be a platform, and the party will grow louder for it.
on-arrival: {!
RG.arrest(Q.lw_cm, RG.lw.rnd(6, 10), {news: Q.lw_cm_name + ' arrested on a treason warrant', priority: 2});
Q.worker_support += 2;
Q.lw_c_trial_next = Q.time + 1;
RG.lw.lean('offensive', 1, 3);
!}

[+ lw_cm_name +] goes home, has supper, and waits. When the police come, the whole street is at its windows, and someone starts singing the Internationale.

@bail
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. A short spell inside, and the case may collapse.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
RG.arrest(Q.lw_cm, 2, {news: Q.lw_cm_name + ' surrenders to the court, released on bail soon', priority: 1});
RG.lw.lean('unionist', 1, 2);
!}

The lawyers bring [+ lw_cm_name +] to the prosecutor's office the next morning, with a statement for the press. The court sets bail, and the money takes a few weeks to find.
